sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Use the free practice area and check in
    %% Stories: 23, 24, 61, 62, 63
    %% Description: A customer books a spot in the free practice area and sees the booked spots per timeslot. At check-in an admin sees the customer's subscription and bookings.
    %% direct CP->BK: booked spots of all customers, not the customer's own bookings
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    actor AD as Admin
    participant CU as Customer
    participant BK as Booking
    participant SP as Spot
    participant SB as Subscription

    %% covers 23
    CP->>CU: book a spot in the free practice area
    CU->>BK: booking
    BK->>SP: booked spot
    %% covers 24
    CP->>BK: see booked spots per timeslot
    %% covers 61
    CP->>CU: check in
    %% covers 62, 63
    AD->>CU: check subscription and bookings at check-in
    CU->>SB: subscription
    CU->>BK: bookings
